  "finding": "Old placement clamps both sides of an asymmetric native model around a centered synthetic door, shrinking the whole facade. Poke-Mart source door lies at x=-8 relative to an asymmetric model, and its large sign extends right.",
  "fix": "Retain original FRLG door position. Scale once from native units (16 per tile), using image pixels per native unit from the render camera. Do not use left/right remaining footprint width as the global scaling limit.",
  "formula": "drawScale=(canvasTilePixels/16)/frame.nativePixelsPerUnit; drawX=doorFootX-frame.anchorX*drawScale; drawY=doorFootY-frame.anchorY*drawScale;",
  "gpuMetadata": "nativePixelsPerUnit = renderedImageWidth/(camera.right-camera.left)",
  "cpuMetadata": "nativePixelsPerUnit = preview.scale; pass this through fallbackFrame()",
  "collision": "Preserve original FRLG walkability and door warps. Do not expand collision from facade image alpha, shadows, signs, or roof bounds.",
